        "description": "<p>The plugin will help you send customers XML Invoices after an order in WooCommerce.</p>\n<p>Requirements:<br />\n&#8211; WordPress<br />\n&#8211; Woocommerce</p>\n",
        "installation": "<p>Installing &#8220;XML Invoices for WooCommerce&#8221; can be done either by searching for &#8220;XML Invoices for WooCommerce&#8221; via the &#8220;Plugins &gt; Add New&#8221; screen in your WordPress dashboard, or by using the following steps:</p>\n<ol>\n<li>Download the plugin via WordPress.org</li>\n<li>Upload the ZIP file through the &#8216;Plugins &gt; Add New &gt; Upload&#8217; screen in your WordPress dashboard</li>\n<li>Activate the plugin through the &#8216;Plugins&#8217; menu in WordPress</li>\n</ol>\n",
        "faq": "\n<dt id='what%20is%20xml%20invoices%20for%20woocommerce%3F'>\nWhat is XML Invoices for WooCommerce?\n</h4>\n<p>\n<p>XML Invoices for WooCommerce is a Woocommerce extension that will let you automatically add XML invoices to order confirmations.</p>\n</p>\n\n",
        "changelog": "<h4>1.0.0</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>2025-10-14</li>\n<li>Initial release</li>\n</ul>\n"
